# football-data.org API token — powers live tournament stats.
# The FREE tier covers the World Cup (WC) and Premier League (PL) — no paid plan.
# Get a free token at https://www.football-data.org/client/register
# On Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables → add FOOTBALL_DATA_TOKEN,
#            then REDEPLOY (env vars only apply to new deployments).
# For local dev with `vercel dev`, copy this file to `.env` and fill it in.
FOOTBALL_DATA_TOKEN=
